<body>
<sync start=410><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>叟深袈猟噴</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　What an inspiring picture!</font>
<sync start=3800><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>叟深袈猟噴</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　What an inspiring picture!</font>
<sync start=8060><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>A cluster of people are playing rope-skipping together, keeping in step.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Two men swaying the rope on each side are counting.</font>
<sync start=13310><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>A cluster of people are playing rope-skipping together, keeping in step.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Two men swaying the rope on each side are counting.</font>
<sync start=16810><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>On careful observation,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　we may discover that one of them counts to ninety-nine,</font>
<sync start=19000><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>On careful observation,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　we may discover that one of them counts to ninety-nine,</font>
<sync start=22390><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>while the other one hundred.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　It seems to me that the painter intends to point out that</font>
<sync start=24730><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>while the other one hundred.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　It seems to me that the painter intends to point out that</font>
<sync start=28550><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>the construction of a harmonious society demands our joint effort and that</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　there may be phenomena that disrupt our social harmony.</font>
<sync start=33910><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>the construction of a harmonious society demands our joint effort and that</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　there may be phenomena that disrupt our social harmony.</font>
<sync start=37850><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>Although it is by no means a simple task to build a society</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　in which people live in harmony with each other and with the nature,</font>
<sync start=42670><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>Although it is by no means a simple task to build a society</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　in which people live in harmony with each other and with the nature,</font>
<sync start=46600><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>we are confident that if everyone contributes to the cause,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　many hands will make light work.</font>
<sync start=50320><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>we are confident that if everyone contributes to the cause,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　many hands will make light work.</font>
<sync start=52720><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>At the same time, it would be unlikely to realize our long-term development goals</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　unless we remain conscious of some widespread problems.</font>
<sync start=58630><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>At the same time, it would be unlikely to realize our long-term development goals</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　unless we remain conscious of some widespread problems.</font>
<sync start=62560><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>There is no denying that we are confronted with</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　increasingly acute social unrest resulting from growing disparity</font>
<sync start=65180><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>There is no denying that we are confronted with</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　increasingly acute social unrest resulting from growing disparity</font>
<sync start=70220><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>between developed coastal area and underdeveloped west,</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　widening gap of the wealthy and the poor,</font>
<sync start=74010><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>between developed coastal area and underdeveloped west,</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　widening gap of the wealthy and the poor,</font>
<sync start=77080><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>environment pollution and government corruption.</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　Since a disharmonious society is not liable to survive hard times,</font>
<sync start=80360><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>environment pollution and government corruption.</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　Since a disharmonious society is not liable to survive hard times,</font>
<sync start=85500><p class=99LRC><font color=#0080FF>it is of great significance that we make concerted effort to eliminate problems</font><br><font color=#C0C0C0>　　　and establish a harmonious and prosperous society.</font>
<sync start=90640><p class=99LRC><font color=#C0C0C0>it is of great significance that we make concerted effort to eliminate problems</font><br><font color=#0080FF>　　　and establish a harmonious and prosperous society.</font>
